{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_4","type":"command_execution","command":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\chuanle song\\\\AppData\\\\Local\\\\Microsoft\\\\WindowsApps\\\\pwsh.exe\" -Command \"Get-Content -LiteralPath 'pipeline/goal.json' -Raw\"","aggregated_output":"{\n  \"metric\": {\n    \"name\": \"mIoU\",\n    \"target\": 0.515,\n    \"dataset\": \"ScanRefer\"\n  },\n  \"baseline_experiment_id\": \"AdaRES-B1\",\n  \"description\": \"AdaRES: improve a faithful standard-indicator 3D referring expression segmentation baseline by learning query confidence from metric-aligned evidence, targeting ScanRefer mIoU >= 0.515.\",\n  \"constraints\": [\n    \"Use server-2 GPUs 0 and 1 only; never use server-6.\",\n    \"All experiments launched after AdaRES-B3 must use exactly one GPU; run at most one independent experiment on GPU 0 and one on GPU 1.\",\n    \"Do not design or queue a successor while AdaRES-B3 is running; after B3 reaches a terminal state, admit at most two structurally independent single-GPU candidates.\",\n    \"Use a fixed 30-epoch protocol for the B2 and B4 extension. Resume both from their epoch-20 last checkpoints without resetting the optimizer or LR scheduler; do not tune the epoch count on validation.\",\n    \"Train from the released SPFormer sparse-UNet backbone; the decoder is authored in this project.\",\n    \"Report mIoU, Acc@0.25, Acc@0.5, active queries, latency, and peak memory.\",\n    \"Do not tune thresholds, temperatures, loss weights, feature subsets, or the fixed 30-epoch protocol on ScanRefer validation.\"\n  ],\n  \"banned\": [\n    \"Do not use server-6.\",\n    \"Do not report the released b005/CFNet checkpoints as AdaRES-B0 results.\",\n    \"Do not scan the ranking margin or the occupancy loss weight on validation.\"\n  ],\n  \"pipeline_policy\": {\n    \"steady_ticks_before_design\": 1,\n    \"fill_to_capacity\": true,\n    \"design_buffer\": 0,\n    \"max_candidates_per_design_tick\": 2\n  }\n}\n\r\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_3","type":"command_execution","command":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\chuanle song\\\\AppData\\\\Local\\\\Microsoft\\\\WindowsApps\\\\pwsh.exe\" -Command \"Get-Content -LiteralPath 'pipeline/codex_memory.md' -Raw\"","aggregated_output":"# AdaRES_project Research Memory\n\n## Goal And Phase\n- Phase 1 ScanRefer mIoU >= 0.515 remains unmet; Phase 2 pending.\n- Root D:/project/AdaRES_project; remote code /bak_home/songcl/Project/AdaRES_project/AdaRES.\n- server-2 GPUs 0/1 only, one single-GPU experiment per card; server-6 excluded.\n- Released SPFormer sparse-UNet backbone plus project decoder. No validation tuning of thresholds, temperatures, weights, feature subsets, margin, occupancy weight, or epochs.\n\n## Champion And Baseline\n- B1 faithful baseline 0.5020 mIoU, Acc@0.25 0.610, Acc@0.5 0.553, spmIoU 0.467.\n- B4-E30 champion 0.5094 mIoU, Acc@0.25 0.608, Acc@0.5 0.562, spmIoU 0.474 at epoch 27; target gap 0.0056.\n- B4-E30 best.pth: /bak_home/songcl/Project/AdaRES_project/AdaRES_checkpoints/adares_b4_query_competition_res/20260921_210214/best.pth.\n\n## Active Hypotheses\n- None admitted or due. New routes require diagnosis, matched controls, native backward, resources, independence and goal constraints. At most two new admissions within queue capacity, not placeholders.\n- B4-E30 fixed 16-scene validation diagnosis: 441 expressions, top-1 0.4919, oracle 0.8732; 240 material selection errors, of which 191 selected/oracle pairs overlap <0.5. This subset does not establish a successor mechanism.\n\n## Closed Or Failed Directions\n- B0 0.333; B2-E30 0.5058; B3 0.5014; B4 20-epoch 0.5070; B5 0.5030; C1-E30 0.5008; C2-E30 0.5014; F4 0.5060. No repeat, scalar tuning, or extension-only successors.\n- E1 cross-layer stability, F1 entropy, F2 spatial compactness, F3 seed proximity rejected from fixed 16-scene diagnoses. Do not scan definitions on validation.\n- F4 mask-centroid decoder reanchoring completed 30/30 at 0.5060, 0.0034 below B4-E30; closed.\n- D1 full-query pairwise confidence completed fresh 30/30 at 0.5080 (rounded epoch 15); Acc@0.25 0.611, Acc@0.5 0.561, spmIoU 0.473 from rounded stdout. Epoch 30 mIoU 0.503. D1 is 0.0014 below champion and 0.0070 below target; route closed.\n- D1 best-checkpoint fixed 16-scene paired intervention: learned rival weights top-1 0.49531 versus uniform 0.50004, 95/441 selections changed; scene bootstrap 95% interval of difference [-0.01889, 0.00909]. Epoch-4 sign was opposite (+0.01188, interval crossing zero). Out-of-distribution diagnostic, not a trained control or full-validation claim.\n\n## Running And Queue\n- 2026-09-25 15:47 +08:00 preflight: no training process on server-2. Active 0/2, no waiting or claiming; candidate budget 2.\n- No due research-work candidate. D1 and F4 closed with terminal evidence; E1 and F1-F3 rejected. Event mode, design_due=false. No queue mutation or launch.\n\n## Open Questions And Risks\n- No pending questions in snapshot manifest. D1 and B4 YAML were byte-identical, but B4-E30 was an epoch-20 optimizer/scheduler-preserving continuation, not a separate fresh matched adaptation control.\n- D1 best-checkpoint fixed-subset active queries 16.05 effective, latency 14.12 ms/expression, peak allocated inference memory 3570 MiB versus B4-E30 11.68, 9.55 ms and 2477 MiB on the same subset. Not full-validation latency or training peak.\n- D1 three native batch backward probes reserved 7.740-10.105 GiB; not worst-case. Final trained-model full-validation resource metrics remain unmeasured.\n- experiments.csv malformed newer append rows; use experiment JSON and analyses for terminal facts. Local Python lacks PyTorch; native inference ran on server-2.\n- Uniform rival intervention was imposed after D1 training and cannot establish whether a separately trained uniform-context control would win. No nonlocal causal or novelty claim.\n\n## Last Tick\n- 2026-09-25 15:47 +08:00 event (research_artifact_changed): no new terminal ID, failure, or due research work. D1/F4 remain closed; design not due. No new decision or admission; six-section report written and old summaries pruned.\n\r\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
