{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_38","type":"command_execution","command":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\chuanle song\\\\AppData\\\\Local\\\\Microsoft\\\\WindowsApps\\\\pwsh.exe\" -Command \"Get-Content -LiteralPath 'pipeline/designs/exp_design_20260922-223000.md' -Raw\"","aggregated_output":"# AdaRES C1/C2 Ranking-Repair Design\n\n## Goal And Baseline\n\n- Goal: ScanRefer mIoU >= 0.5150.\n- Champion and direct baseline: `AdaRES-B4-E30`, mIoU 0.5094.\n- Warm-start checkpoint:\n  `/bak_home/songcl/Project/AdaRES_project/AdaRES_checkpoints/adares_b4_query_competition_res/20260921_210214/best.pth`.\n- Both candidates preserve the B4 architecture and parameters. Only the\n  indicator-ranking objective changes.\n\n## Common Notation\n\nFor expression sample `b`, let `z_i = (z_i^+, z_i^-)` be the two-class\nindicator logits of query `i`, and define the ranking score\n\n```text\ns_i = z_i^+ - z_i^-.\n```\n\nLet `M_i` be the query mask and `Y_t` a ground-truth object mask. Define the\noracle query quality as\n\n```text\nu_i = max_t IoU(sigmoid(M_i) >= 0.5, Y_t > 0.5).\n```\n\n## C1: Listwise Expected-Mask Ranking\n\n### Ranking Distribution\n\n```text\np_i = softmax(s_i / tau_s)\nq_i = softmax(u_i / tau_u)\n```\n\nThe listwise objective is the KL divergence from the model ranking\ndistribution to the oracle-IoU distribution:\n\n```text\nL_rank = KL(q || p)\n       = sum_i q_i (log q_i - log p_i).\n```\n\nIts score gradient is\n\n```text\ndL_rank/ds_i = (p_i - q_i) / tau_s.\n```\n\nThus a query is pushed upward in proportion to how much more oracle IoU it has\nthan the model currently assigns to it.\n\n### Expected-Mask Coupling\n\nThe same probability distribution defines an expected mask:\n\n```text\nM_bar = sum_i p_i sigmoid(M_i).\n```\n\nThe expected mask is supervised by\n\n```text\nL_expected = BCE(M_bar, Y) + Dice(M_bar, Y).\n```\n\nThe total objective is\n\n```text\nL = L_B4 + lambda_rank L_rank + lambda_mask L_expected.\n```\n\nFixed constants: `tau_s = 0.1`, `tau_u = 0.05`, `lambda_rank = 1.0`,\n`lambda_mask = 0.5`.\n\n### Hypothesis\n\nB4 uses local pairwise overlap context. C1 instead supervises the global\nordering of all queries and ties that ordering to the mask objective. This\ntests whether top-1 selection fails because the ranking problem was too local.\n\n## C2: Hard-Negative IoU Margin\n\nChoose the best query and the hardest confidently wrong query:\n\n```text\na = argmax_i u_i\nb = argmax_{j: u_j <= u_a - delta} s_j.\n```\n\nOptimize the IoU-scaled hinge objective\n\n```text\nL_hn = max(0, m_0 + lambda_iou (u_a - u_b) - (s_a - s_b)).\n```\n\nThe oracle IoUs are stop-gradient targets. The active gradient is\n\n```text\ndL_hn/ds_a = -1,\ndL_hn/ds_b = +1\n```\n\nwhen the margin is violated. Fixed constants: `m_0 = 0.1`, `lambda_iou = 1.0`,\n`delta = 0.05`.\n\n### Hypothesis\n\nB4 improves average competition context, but top-1 errors are decided by a\nsmall number of hard negatives. C2 directly increases the margin between the\nbest-IoU query and the highest-scoring query that is materially worse.\n\n## Protocol\n\n- Warm start both variants from the same B4-E30 `best.pth`.\n- Train 10 epochs, seed 1999, batch size 2, and one GPU per experiment.\n- Learning rate 2e-5; optimizer and scheduler otherwise match B4.\n- No validation-based tuning of temperatures, margins, loss weights, or epoch\n  count.\n- `min_epochs = 10` and `patience = 10` prevent premature stopping.\n\n## Evaluation And Controls\n\n- Metrics: mIoU, Acc@0.25, Acc@0.50, spmIoU, spAcc@0.25, spAcc@0.50.\n- Efficiency: active queries, latency, and peak memory when measured.\n- Direct control: B4-E30 under the identical initialization and inference\n  protocol.\n- A candidate is useful if it exceeds mIoU 0.5094. The phase target remains\n  mIoU >= 0.5150.\n- C1 and C2 are structurally distinct: global listwise distribution matching\n  plus expected-mask coupling versus sparse hard-negative margin correction.\n\n## Risks\n\n- C1 may collapse the ranking distribution or blur the expected mask if the\n  score entropy becomes too low.\n- C2 may update only a small number of hard-negative samples per batch.\n- Warm-start adaptation cannot prove gains from scratch, but it is the\n  appropriate protocol for testing a correction on the current champion.\n- ScanRefer validation is used only for the fixed scheduled checkpoints, not\n  for tuning the new constants.\n\r\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_40","type":"command_execution","command":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\chuanle song\\\\AppData\\\\Local\\\\Microsoft\\\\WindowsApps\\\\pwsh.exe\" -Command \"Get-Content -LiteralPath 'D:\\\\project\\\\.agents\\\\skills\\\\songcl_research_pipeline\\\\references\\\\formats.md' | Select-Object -Skip 245 -First 80\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_39","type":"command_execution","command":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\chuanle song\\\\AppData\\\\Local\\\\Microsoft\\\\WindowsApps\\\\pwsh.exe\" -Command \"Get-Content -LiteralPath 'AdaRES/tools/diagnose_adares_f1_mask_uncertainty.py' -TotalCount 170\"","aggregated_output":"import argparse\r\nimport json\r\nimport statistics\r\nimport sys\r\nimport types\r\nfrom pathlib import Path\r\n\r\nimport gorilla\r\nimport torch\r\nimport torch.nn.functional as F\r\n\r\nROOT = Path(__file__).resolve().parents[1]\r\nsys.path.insert(0, str(ROOT))\r\nsys.path.insert(0, str(Path.cwd()))\r\n\r\nfrom ipdn.dataset import build_dataset\r\nfrom ipdn.model_paper5.adares_b4_query_competition import IPDN\r\nfrom ipdn.utils import get_root_logger\r\n\r\n\r\ndef predictor():\r\n    def predict_by_feat(\r\n        self, scan_ids, object_idss, ann_ids, out, superpoints,\r\n        gt_pmasks, gt_spmasks, fps_seed_sp,\r\n    ):\r\n        rows = []\r\n        for index, target in enumerate(gt_pmasks):\r\n            valid = ~out[\"batch_mask\"][index]\r\n            logits = out[\"masks\"][index][:, valid]\r\n            probabilities = logits.sigmoid()\r\n            entropy = F.binary_cross_entropy_with_logits(\r\n                logits, probabilities, reduction=\"none\"\r\n            ).mean(-1)\r\n            masks = out[\"masks\"][index].sigmoid().gt(0.5)[:, superpoints]\r\n            truth = target.gt(0.5).to(masks.device)\r\n            ious = ((masks & truth).sum(-1).float() /\r\n                    (masks | truth).sum(-1).clamp_min(1).float())\r\n            scores = F.softmax(out[\"indis\"][index], dim=-1)[:, 1]\r\n            selected = int(scores.argmax())\r\n            oracle = int(ious.argmax())\r\n            rows.append({\r\n                \"selected_iou\": float(ious[selected]),\r\n                \"oracle_iou\": float(ious[oracle]),\r\n                \"selected_entropy\": float(entropy[selected]),\r\n                \"oracle_entropy\": float(entropy[oracle]),\r\n                \"entropy_argmin_iou\": float(ious[entropy.argmin()]),\r\n            })\r\n        return {\"rows\": rows}\r\n\r\n    return predict_by_feat\r\n\r\n\r\ndef main():\r\n    parser = argparse.ArgumentParser()\r\n    parser.add_argument(\"config\")\r\n    parser.add_argument(\"checkpoint\")\r\n    parser.add_argument(\"--output\", required=True)\r\n    parser.add_argument(\"--scenes\", type=int, default=16)\r\n    parser.add_argument(\"--gpu-id\", type=int, default=1)\r\n    args = parser.parse_args()\r\n\r\n    gorilla.set_cuda_visible_devices([args.gpu_id], 1)\r\n    gorilla.set_random_seed(1999)\r\n    cfg = gorilla.Config.fromfile(args.config)\r\n    data_cfg = cfg.data.val.copy()\r\n    data_cfg.training = False\r\n    data_cfg.aug = False\r\n    data_cfg.with_elastic = False\r\n    data_cfg.lang_num_max = 32\r\n    dataset = build_dataset(data_cfg, get_root_logger())\r\n    model = IPDN(**cfg.model)\r\n    model.cuda()\r\n    checkpoint = torch.load(args.checkpoint, map_location=\"cpu\")\r\n    loaded = model.load_state_dict(checkpoint.get(\"model\", checkpoint), strict=False)\r\n    allowed = {\r\n        \"text_encoder.embeddings.position_ids\",\r\n        \"text_encoder.embeddings.token_type_ids\",\r\n    }\r\n    if loaded.missing_keys or set(loaded.unexpected_keys) - allowed:\r\n        raise RuntimeError(f\"Checkpoint mismatch: {loaded}\")\r\n    model.eval()\r\n    model.predict_by_feat = types.MethodType(predictor(), model)\r\n    rows = []\r\n    for index in range(min(args.scenes, len(dataset))):\r\n        with torch.no_grad():\r\n            rows.extend(model(dataset.collate_fn([dataset[index]]), mode=\"predict\")[\"rows\"])\r\n    if not rows:\r\n        raise RuntimeError(\"No expressions in fixed subset\")\r\n    errors = [row for row in rows if row[\"oracle_iou\"] - row[\"selected_iou\"] > 0.05]\r\n    result = {\r\n        \"checkpoint\": args.checkpoint,\r\n        \"scenes\": min(args.scenes, len(dataset)),\r\n        \"expressions\": len(rows),\r\n        \"material_errors\": len(errors),\r\n        \"error_oracle_lower_entropy\": sum(\r\n            row[\"oracle_entropy\"] < row[\"selected_entropy\"] for row in errors\r\n        ),\r\n        \"error_selected_entropy_mean\": statistics.fmean(\r\n            row[\"selected_entropy\"] for row in errors\r\n        ),\r\n        \"error_oracle_entropy_mean\": statistics.fmean(\r\n            row[\"oracle_entropy\"] for row in errors\r\n        ),\r\n        \"entropy_argmin_miou\": statistics.fmean(\r\n            row[\"entropy_argmin_iou\"] for row in rows\r\n        ),\r\n        \"selected_miou\": statistics.fmean(row[\"selected_iou\"] for row in rows),\r\n        \"rows\": rows,\r\n    }\r\n    Path(args.output).write_text(json.dumps(result, indent=2), encoding=\"utf-8\")\r\n    print(json.dumps({key: value for key, value in result.items() if key != \"rows\"}))\r\n\r\n\r\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\r\n    main()\r\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_40","type":"command_execution","command":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\chuanle song\\\\AppData\\\\Local\\\\Microsoft\\\\WindowsApps\\\\pwsh.exe\" -Command \"Get-Content -LiteralPath 'D:\\\\project\\\\.agents\\\\skills\\\\songcl_research_pipeline\\\\references\\\\formats.md' | Select-Object -Skip 245 -First 80\"","aggregated_output":"  - 矛盾/疑问: ...\r\n\r\n## 5. Design Rationale（Q2+Q3: 为什么设计这批变体）\r\n  - 每个变体填补哪个缺口\r\n  - 预期结果对故事线的推进\r\n\r\n## 6. Next Batch\r\n  → 见 pipeline/designs/exp_design_<ts>.md\r\n================================================================================\r\n```\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## 5. 消融方案\r\n\r\n`pipeline/designs/ablation_plan_<ts>.md`，PHASE1_REACHED 后生成、与用户讨论用：\r\n\r\n```\r\n================================================================================\r\n  Ablation Plan — <project_name>\r\n  Champion: <champion_id> (mIoU=X.XXXX, config=<path>)\r\n  <YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS>\r\n================================================================================\r\n\r\n## 1. Champion Architecture Analysis\r\n  - Config: configs/.../xxx.yaml\r\n  - Model: <model_package>\r\n  - Key design choices:\r\n    1. <设计选择1>: <描述> (config 字段: xxx)\r\n    2. <设计选择2>: <描述> (config 字段: yyy)\r\n    3. ...\r\n\r\n## 2. Proposed Ablations\r\n| # | ID | 消融什么 | 对照实验 | 假设 | 预计 Δ | Priority |\r\n|---|----|---------|---------|------|--------|----------|\r\n| 1 | abl-XX | 去掉 L1 loss | l1_weight=0 | L1 对收敛稳定关键 | -0.005~-0.010 | P0 |\r\n| 2 | abl-YY | pos encoding A→B | pos_enc=B | posA 优于 B | -0.003~-0.008 | P1 |\r\n| 3 | abl-ZZ | 关掉 refine | refine=false | refine 收益 0.003 | -0.003 | P1 |\r\n\r\n## 3. Implementation Details\r\n  (每个消融的 config 路径、改动点、是否需要新 model 代码)\r\n\r\n## 4. GPU Allocation\r\n  (消融实验的排队计划，与现有队列的优先级协调)\r\n\r\n================================================================================\r\n  Status: DRAFT → DISCUSSING → APPROVED → IMPLEMENTING → DONE\r\n  Created: <YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM>\r\n  Approved: (用户确认时间)\r\n================================================================================\r\n```\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## 6. 决策记录与索引\r\n\r\n单次决策 `pipeline/decisions/<YYYYMMDD-HHMMSS>_<type>.md`（由 `log_decision.sh` 写入，无需手写）：\r\n\r\n```\r\n# <project> 决策记录\r\n\r\n- **时间**: <YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS>\r\n- **类型**: early_stop | queue_push | next_batch | route_change | question | manual | manual_batch | other\r\n- **问题**: <当时面临的选择，含关键数字>\r\n- **决策**: <具体动作，哪个 config、哪台服务器、哪块 GPU>\r\n- **依据**: <判断逻辑>\r\n- **证据**: <数据来源，如 pipeline_monitor 输出、experiments.csv 等>\r\n```\r\n\r\n索引 `pipeline/decisions/_index.md`：\r\n\r\n```\r\n# <project> 决策索引\r\n\r\n| 时间 | 类型 | 问题 | 决策 |\r\n|------|------|------|------|\r\n| 2026-07-17 06:56:46 | route_change | A3 true_route 已 kill... | 推送 B4 refine 变体... |\r\n```\r\n\r\n---\r\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
